Camera FrontBack transforms your iPhone into a multi-cam allowing you to capture video from two cameras simultaneously.

With our video App, we want people around the world to shoot amazing views, architecture, pets, and friends while allowing them to express their emotions on one screen. Try and get surprised at how you reacted to something important to you at the moment.

Features:
◆ Picture-in-picture (PIP);
◆ Simultaneous work with front and rear cameras;
◆ Animates in real-time;
◆ Circle mode;
◆ Oval mode;
◆ Square mode;
◆ Full-Screen mode;
◆ Split-screen mode;
◆ Pinch-to-zoom;
◆ Capture moment;
◆ Moveable around the screen;
◆ PiP Mixers;

it has a user-friendly interface and it's easy to use.

Joins your images in a fast and simple way.

Features: 
- on loading, select the image resolution (high/medium/low);
- expand or reduce the image size; 
- join multiple images;
- blend your images making transparent the edges; 
- move the selected image in front or back of other images; 
- crop the image; 
- "snap to grid" function; 
- undo/redo your modify;
- on ending, the resulting image are automatically trimmed and the transparent border/contour is removed;
- save the resulting image and share it.
